Log-to-LLM Sentinel is an AI-powered log monitoring and analysis tool. It watches your logs and automatically uses local AI (Ollama) to detect, analyze, and alert you of anomalies in real-time.
[i]Custom Log Volumes:[/i] If you want Sentinel to monitor specific logs not located in /var/log or /var/lib/docker, add a new Path in this template. Map your host directory to a container path (e.g. /custom-logs), and then add that path to the SENTINEL_BROWSE_ROOTS variable separated by a comma.

[b]🇫🇷 Français[/b]
Log-to-LLM Sentinel est un outil de surveillance et d'analyse de journaux (logs) propulsé par l'IA. Il surveille vos logs et utilise automatiquement une IA locale (Ollama) pour détecter, analyser et vous alerter des anomalies en temps réel.
