, Slack, Telegram and more.

Open the web UI and sign in with your Facebook username and password. aimm logs in to Facebook in its own browser; if Facebook asks for a CAPTCHA or a security code, click Open browser in the web UI and complete it there. Then describe what you are looking for to the Assistant, or edit config.toml in the web UI.

