rding headers; see networking documentation.    ||    Wiki: https://github.com/Crosis47/tmodloader/wiki/Configuration#web-dashboard";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:8;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:23:"Administrator hash file";s:6:"Target";s:19:"TMOD_WEB_TOKEN_FILE";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:241:"WebUI only. Optional container path to an existing Argon2id credential hash file; add a matching read-only file mount. Empty uses first-run setup.    ||    Wiki: https://github.com/Crosis47/tmodloader/wiki/Configuration#web-dashboard";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:9;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:21:"Workshop API key file";s:6:"Target";s:22:"TMOD_WORKSHOP_KEY_FILE";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:239:"WebUI only. Optional container path to a Steam API key file; add a matching read-only file mount. A key saved in the dashboard takes precedence.    ||    Wiki: https://github.com/Crosis47/tmodloader/wiki/Configuration#web-dashboard";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:10;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:18:"Game password file";s:6:"Target";s:14:"TMOD_PASS_FILE";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:231:"Optional path inside the container; add a matching read-only file mount. Saved dashboard passwords override this in web mode.    ||    Wiki: https://github.com/Crosis47/tmodloader/wiki/Configuration#change-the-game-password";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:11;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:25:"Automatic runtime updates";s:6:"Target";s:16:"TMOD_AUTO_UPDATE";s:7:"Default";s:3:"1|0";s:11:"Description";s:226:"1 checks and tests runtime 