 PDF, exchange with nexlore and Obsidian as JSON Canvas. Spaces with read, write and manage rights, accounts by invitation or OpenID Connect (one-button setup for authentik), an optional second factor, public pages, backups and a log. English and German, light and dark, works on the phone.";s:5:"WebUI";s:24:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8000]/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:89:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DerKezorm/unraid-templates/main/templates/nexcanvas.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:85:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DerKezorm/unraid-templates/main/icons/nexcanvas.png";s:4:"Date";s:10:"2026-10-04";s:10:"Networking";a:1:{s:4:"Mode";s:6:"bridge";}s:6:"Config";a:12:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8000";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8500";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:49:"Port you reach nexcanvas at. Container port: 8000";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8500";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:28:"Data (Container Path: /data)";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/data";s:7:"Default";s:27:"/mnt/user/appdata/nexcanvas";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:182:"Holds the SQLite database with accounts, spaces and boards, the photos and files on the boards, the key secret.key, backups and logs. Keep it on a local disk, not on a network share.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:27:"/mnt/user/appdata/nexcanvas";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:4:"PUID";s:6:"Target";s:4:"PUID";s:7:"Default";s:2:"99";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:69:"User id that should own the files in /data. 99 is the Unraid default.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:2:"99";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:4:"PGID";s:6:"Target";s:4:"PGID";s:7:"Default";s:3:"100";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:71: