"Target";s:21:"BACKUP_INTERVAL_HOURS";s:7:"Default";s:2:"24";s:11:"Description";s:238:"How often (hours) to write an automatic compacted database snapshot into Data Directory/backups. A snapshot is also always taken just before a schema migration, and on demand from the Health page. Set to 0 to disable the scheduled backup.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:2:"24";}i:35;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:16:"BACKUP_RETENTION";s:6:"Target";s:16:"BACKUP_RETENTION";s:7:"Default";s:2:"14";s:11:"Description";s:99:"How many database snapshots to keep in Data Directory/backups. Older ones are pruned automatically.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:2:"14";}i:36;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"BACKUP_DIR";s:6:"Target";s:10:"BACKUP_DIR";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:158:"Optional. Directory (inside the container) for database snapshots. Leave blank to use Data Directory/backups; must sit inside the Data Directory mount if set.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:37;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:17:"BACKUP_WEBDAV_URL";s:6:"Target";s:17:"BACKUP_WEBDAV_URL";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:328:"Optional. Off-site backups: a WebDAV folder URL (e.g. a Nextcloud path like https://cloud.example.com/remote.php/dav/files/me/sylo-backups). After every local snapshot a gzipped copy is PUT to url/name.db.gz. With a username it must be https (or a LAN / container address). Best-effort and logged; never blocks the local backup.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:38;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:18:"BACKUP_WEBDAV_USER";s:6:"Target";s:18:"BACKUP_WEBDAV_USER";s:7:"Default";