SAS2 (9200 family, via the bundled lsiutil) and SAS3 / SAS3.5 tri-mode (9300 / 9400
families, via the system storcli), with the backend auto-detected per card and
multiple controllers shown side by side.

Per-controller temperature with a health rollup, PHY link/speed/error counters,
attached drives (enclosure/slot, model, serial, state, SAS address), per-drive and
background SMART, a firmware event log archived to /boot, an enclosure/topology
summary, and a dashboard tile (Unraid 7.2+). SAS and SATA drives supported.

storcli must be installed for SAS3/3.5 cards; lsiutil is bundled for SAS2.
