ce";s:8:"Overview";s:843:"Rebalance your array after large data moves. Moves data between array disks so every
data disk ends up filled to the same percentage of its capacity: a 14 TB disk holds
proportionally more than a 10 TB disk.

Builds a plan first (dry run), then moves whole folders disk-to-disk with rsync, keeping
their paths so user shares are unchanged. Honors each share's included/excluded disks,
never touches cache or pools, and keeps parity valid throughout. Pauses for parity checks
and the mover, and skips items that have open files, were written recently, contain
in-progress downloads or are hardlinked elsewhere (e.g. torrent/media links).

Live dashboard under Settings, User Utilities: overall progress, the current move with
speed and ETA, each disk against its target, the queue, recent moves and the log, with
pause, stop and abort controls.";s:9:"PluginURL";s:79:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FugginOld/Unraid-Rebalance/main/rebalance.plg";s:12:"PluginAuthor";s:9:"FugginOld";s:7:"Support";s:52:"https://github.com/FugginOld/Unraid-Rebalance/issues";s:7:"Project";s:45:"https://github.com/FugginOld/Unraid-Rebalance";s:6:"ReadMe";s:75:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FugginOld/Unraid-Rebalance/main/README.md";s:4:"Beta";s:4:"true";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:4:"Icon";s:74:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FugginOld/Unraid-Rebalance/main/icon.png";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:92:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FugginOld/unraid-templates/main/plugins/unraid-balance.xml";s:12:"TemplatePath";s:46:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/plugins/unraid-balance.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:22:"FugginOld's Repository";s:10:"Repository";s:79:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FugginOld/Unraid-Rebalance/main/rebalance.plg";s:12:"CategoryList";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"Tools-System";i:1;s:7:"Plugins";}s:6:"Plugin";b:1;s:13:"pluginVersion";s:10:"2026.09.28";s:6:"MinVer";s:6:"6.12.0";s:6:"Author";s:9:"FugginOld";s:16:"ChangeLogPresent";s:1:"1";s:9:"downloads";i:232;s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1790646369;s:14:"LastUpdateScan";i:1792411842;s:11:"pluginStats";a:13:{i:10;i:149;i:11;i:0;i:12;i:0;s:2:"01";i:0;s:2:"02";i:0;s:2:"03";i:0;s:2:"04";i:0;s:2:"05";i:0;s:2:"06";i:0;s:2:"07";i:0;s:2:"08";i:0;s:2:"09";i:83;s:1:"T";i:232;}s:8:"Category";s:21:"Tools:System Plugins:";s:2:"ID";i:469;s:11:"Displayable";b:1;s:13:"DockerHubName";s:15:"array rebalance";s:8:"RepoName";s:22:"FugginOld's Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:9:"FugginOld";s:8:"SortName";s:15:"Array Rebalance";s:6:"random";i:923553310;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:4:"Path";s:186:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/FugginOldsRepository/FugginOld-ArrayRebalance-//raw.githubusercontent.com/FugginOld/Unraid-Rebalance/main/rebalance.plg.xml";s:4:"Date";N;s:11:"BrandNewApp";b:1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:470;a:38:{s:4:"Name";s:11: