1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:481;a:44:{s:4:"Name";s:9:"cashpilot";s:10:"Repository";s:27:"drumsergio/cashpilot:latest";s:8:"Registry";s:45:"https://hub.docker.com/r/drumsergio/cashpilot";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:43:"https://github.com/GeiserX/CashPilot/issues";s:7:"Project";s:36:"https://github.com/GeiserX/CashPilot";s:8:"Overview";s:777:"CashPilot is a self-hosted passive income orchestrator. Deploy, manage, and monitor bandwidth-sharing, DePIN, storage, and GPU compute Docker containers from a single web dashboard. Tracks earnings across 49 services with historical charts and trend analysis.
[br][br]
This is the UI container. It provides the web dashboard, earnings collection, service catalog, and fleet management. It does NOT require Docker socket access.
[br][br]
[b]You also need the CashPilot Worker container[/b] on each server where you want to deploy passive income services. The worker manages Docker containers and reports back to this UI.
[br][br]
