run/docker";s:6:"ReadMe";s:24:"https://docs.filerun.com";s:7:"Project";s:19:"https://filerun.com";s:8:"Overview";s:846:"FileRun is a self-hosted file sync and share web-based application - Like Google Drive, but private, and under your full control!

