Movies come from Radarr's recommendations, Seerr's endless discover feed, or both blended together; TV comes from Seerr (Overseerr/Jellyseerr), since Sonarr has no recommendation feed to swipe. A Movies/TV/Both toggle picks what's showing, and coloured per-type badges tell movie and TV cards apart at a glance. Swipe right to add (Radarr) or request (Seerr), left to exclude or skip — every card carries its own origin, so a blended deck routes each swipe to the right backend on its own. Undo reverses the last one, up to 50 deep. Filter by genre and minimum rating.

Connect Radarr and/or Seerr in the app's Settings screen, each with a Test button; API keys stay server-side and are never sent to the browser. LAN-only, no login, no cloud. Needs at least one of Radarr (v3) or Seerr — movies work with either or both, TV requires Seerr.

