[b]Features:[/b]
- [b]Multi-Instance Support:[/b] Manage Radarr, Sonarr, and Lidarr from a single service.
- [b]Smart Staggering:[/b] Prevents "thundering herd" issues by spacing out search requests.
- [b]Proportional Interleaving:[/b] Balanced searching between missing items and upgrades.
- [b]Weighted Distribution:[/b] Prioritize specific instances.
