**What it does**
- Picks which campaign to watch, and moves to another channel when a stream goes offline
- Collects channel points and watch-streak bonuses on your favourite channels
- Lists anything that needs you, such as a game account to link
- Web dashboard for priorities, skipped games, pinned campaigns and history, phone included
- Optional notifications to Discord, Telegram, ntfy, Slack, Pushover, Gotify or any webhook

**Getting started**
