Under the hood it uses mkvmerge for Matroska and ffmpeg stream-copy for MP4-family, and validates the remuxed output before replacing the original, so a failed run leaves your source untouched. New imports can be auto-processed via webhook, and per-directory profiles let different folders (anime vs movies, say) follow different rules.

Features:
- Language priority and per-language track limits (e.g. keep only the best English audio), tuned for quality or smallest size.
- Metadata cleanup of encoder/codec junk in track names, applied instantly with mkvpropedit (no remux for metadata-only changes).
- Library overview of codecs, resolutions and languages, plus a stats API for dashboards.
- Supports Matroska (.mkv, .webm) and MP4-family (.mp4, .m4v).

Paths: mount your library at the SAME path your Sonarr/Radarr containers use (e.g. /media). If they differ, add a Path Mapping under Settings > Integrations in Muxarr. Add more /media style mappings for libraries that live on other shares.";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:195:"mkvmerge mkvtoolnix mkvpropedit ffmpeg remux mux audio subtitle track strip clean cleanup commentary sdh dub dual anime metadata bitrate space saving webm m4v jellyfin plex emby sonarr radarr arr";s:5:"WebUI";s:24:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8183]/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:79:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KirovAir/muxarr/master/docs/unraid/muxarr.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:79:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KirovAir/muxarr/master/docs/unraid/muxarr.png";s:10:"Screenshot";a:5:{i:0;s:87:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KirovAir/muxarr/master/docs/screenshots/dashboard.png";i:1;s:84:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KirovAir/muxarr/master/docs/screenshots/before.png";i:2;s:83:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KirovAir/muxarr/master/docs/screenshots/after.png";i:3;s:89:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KirovAir/muxarr/master/docs/screenshots/filedetails.png";i:4;s:88:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KirovAir/muxarr/master/docs/screenshots/statistics.png";}s:6:"Config";a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:5:"WebUI";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8183";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8183";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:19:"Web interface port.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8183";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:6:"Config";s:6:"Target";s:7:"/config";s:7:"Default";s:24:"/mnt/user/appdata/muxarr";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:22:"Database and settings.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:24:"/mnt/user/appdata/muxarr";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:5:"Media";s:6:"Target";s:6:"/media";s:7:"Default";s:15:"/mnt/user/