The plugin installs as an Unraid notify agent. It does not add its own monitor function. It sends
the notifications that Unraid makes. These include parity checks, disk errors, SMART warnings and
array events. Your User Scripts can also send notifications with the notify command. The plugin
sends a heartbeat signal at regular intervals. Then your phone can show the difference between a
correct server and a server that is not on the network.

The plugin encrypts the content of each event on your server with ChaCha20-Poly1305. The encryption
occurs before the data goes out of your local network. The key is in two locations only: the
configuration file on your server, and the keychain on the paired phone. The relay that sends the
push message receives ciphertext only. The relay cannot read the text of your notifications. The
plugin does not send your Unraid API key, your host name, or other local secrets.

The plugin is free and open source. The push messages go to Flotilla, an iOS app for Unraid and
Proxmox. The push function needs the Pro option in that app, which costs USD 4.99 one time.

The settings page is at Settings, then Flotilla Agent. You pair the phone with a QR code.";s:9:"PluginURL";s:87:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Livin21/flotilla-agent/main/plugin/flotilla-agent.plg";s:12:"PluginAuthor";s:22:"Livin Mathew (livin21)";s:7:"Support";s:101:"https://forums.unraid.net/topic/200208-plugin-flotilla-agent-encrypted-push-notifications-for-unraid/";s:7:"Project";s:41:"https://github.com/Livin21/flotilla-agent";s:6:"ReadMe";s:71:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Livin21/flotilla-agent/main/README.md";s:4:"Icon";s:70:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Livin21/flotilla-agent/main/icon.png";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:88:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Livin21/flotilla-agent/main/plugins/flotilla-agent.xml";s:12:"TemplatePath";s:46:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/plugins/flotilla-agent.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:20:"livin21's Repository";s:10:"Repository";s:87:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Livin21/flotilla-agent/main/plugin/flotilla-agent.plg";s:12:"CategoryList";a:2:{i:0;s:15:"Tools-Utilities";i:1;s:7:"Plugins";}s:6:"Plugin";b:1;s:13:"pluginVersion";s:10:"2026.08.07";s:6:"MinVer";s:5:"7.0.0";s:6:"Author";s:22:"Livin Mathew (livin21)";s:16:"ChangeLogPresent";s:1:"1";s:9:"downloads";i:14;s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1787011571;s:14:"LastUpdateScan";i:1791198847;s:11:"pluginStats";a:13:{i:10;i:1;i:11;i:0;i:12;i:0;s:2:"01";i:0;s:2:"02";i:0;s:2:"03";i:0;s:2:"04";i:0;s:2:"05";i:0;s:2:"06";i:0;s:2:"07";i:0;s:2:"08";i:10;s:2:"09";i:3;s:1:"T";i:14;}s:8:"Category";s:24:"Tools:Utilities Plugins:";s:2:"ID";i:801;s:11:"Displayable";b:1;s:13:"DockerHubName";s:14:"flotilla agent";s:8:"RepoName";s:20:"livin21's Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:22:"Livin Mathew (livin21)";s:8:"SortName";s:14:"Flotilla Agent";s:6:"random";i:523186474;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:4:"Path";s:200:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/livin21sRepository/LivinMathewlivin21-FlotillaAgent-//raw.githubusercontent.com/Livin21/flotilla-agent/main/plugin/flotilla-agent.plg.xml