l";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:61:"https://github.com/Lucifix/model-workshop-manager/discussions";s:7:"Project";s:49:"https://github.com/Lucifix/model-workshop-manager";s:6:"ReadMe";s:56:"https://github.com/Lucifix/model-workshop-manager#readme";s:8:"Overview";s:949:"Model Workshop Manager keeps your scale-model hobby in one place: a searchable catalog of kits and paints kept separate from what you actually own, barcode scanning to check whether you already have a kit, a one-click starter catalog of 10,000+ paints from 30+ brands (Tamiya, Vallejo, Citadel, Mr. Hobby, AK and more), builds with progress photos and "required vs. owned" paint matching, a shopping list and wishlist, supplies with low-stock alerts, CSV/JSON import and export, and in-app backups. Installable as a PWA on phone and desktop.

Single-user and private by default: one SQLite file and your photos on your own disk, no accounts, no cloud, no tracking.

First run: open the WebUI and create your username and password on the one-time setup screen. Nothing else needs configuring.

