    It connects to the Portabase Dashboard and executes database backup
    and restore tasks for configured database connections.

    An EDGE_KEY generated by the Portabase Dashboard is required
    to authenticate the agent.

    SECURITY:
    Keep EDGE_KEY confidential. Anyone possessing this key may be able
    to authenticate as the associated agent.

    NETWORK:
    The agent does not require an exposed web port. Ensure that it can
    reach the Portabase Dashboard over HTTPS and the database servers
    it is configured to manage.

