oderatorComment";s:41:"Repository no longer exists on docker hub";s:8:"Overview";s:240:"Xteve is a IPTV Proxy for Plex. It takes a M3U list from an IPTV provider and allows filtering with regex along with channel mapping to EPG. It will then generate a local EPG that Plex can understand. For this to all work you need plexpass.";s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1549526480;s:14:"LastUpdateScan";i:1778325179;s:12:"CategoryList";a:0:{}s:8:"Category";s:6:"Other:";s:2:"ID";i:909;s:11:"Displayable";b:1;s:6:"Author";s:5:"bl0m1";s:13:"DockerHubName";s:5:"xteve";s:8:"RepoName";s:24:"Mudislander's Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:5:"bl0m1";s:8:"SortName";s:5:"xteve";s:6:"random";i:752292634;s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.0";s:4:"Path";s:108:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/MudislandersRepository/bl0m1-xteve-latest.xml";s:4:"Date";N;s:11:"BrandNewApp";b:1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"Compatible";b:1;}i:910;a:46:{s:4:"Name";s:8:"ironsbot";s:10:"Repository";s:28:"murmansk5000/ironsbot:latest";s:8:"Registry";s:46:"https://hub.docker.com/r/murmansk5000/ironsbot";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:47:"https://github.com/Murmansk5000/IronsBot/issues";s:7:"Project";s:40:"https://github.com/Murmansk5000/IronsBot";s:8:"Overview";s:458:"EN: IronsBot supports OneBot v11/NapCat and Tencent QQ Official Bot. A TOML AppID with its APP_SECRET_AppID automatically makes QQ Official the only outbound platform; NapCat then stays silent and may only observe identity verification events. ZH: IronsBot 支持 OneBot v11/NapCat 与腾讯 QQ 官方机器人。TOML AppID 配合 APP_SECRET_AppID 会自动使 QQ 官方成为唯一出站平台；NapCat 随即静默，只可用于身份验证事件观察。";s:5:"WebUI";s:23:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8080]";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:83:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Murmansk5000/IronsBot/main/templates/ironsbot.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:69:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Murmansk5000/IronsBot/main/icon.png";s:6:"ReadMe";s:77:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Murmansk5000/IronsBot/main/docker/README.md";s:8:"Requires";s:808:"EN: OneBot mode requires a client such as NapCat; point its reverse WebSocket to ws://UNRAID_SERVER_IP:8085/onebot/v11/ws, or ws://ironsbot:8080/onebot/v11/ws on a shared Docker network. Published IronsBot images already include the QQ Official runtime; declare each public AppID in TOML and add one masked APP_SECRET_AppID variable. Pre-create /config/ironsbot.toml and mount /app/data and /app/logs. ZH: OneBot 模式需要 NapCat 等客户端，反向 WebSocket 可填写 ws://UNRAID_SERVER_IP:8085/onebot/v11/ws；共用 Docker 网络时可填写 ws://ironsbot:8080/onebot/v11/ws。正式 IronsBot 镜像已包含 QQ 官方运行组件；请在 TOML 声明每个公开 AppID，并添加一个加密的 APP_SECRET_AppID 变量。请预先创建 /config/ironsbot.toml，并挂载 /app/data 和 /app/logs。";s:6:"Config";a:19:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:19:"Host WebSocket Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8080";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8085";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:221:"EN: Host port mapped to the fixed container port 8080. Point the OneBot reverse WebSocket to this host port. ZH: WebSocket 主机端口，映射到固定的容器内 8080；OneBot 反向 WebSocket 连接此主机端口。";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8085";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"IronsBot Data";s:6:"Target";s:9:"/app/data";s:7:"Default";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/ironsbot/data";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:163:"EN: Persistent runtime data, including caches, cookies, and SQLite databases. ZH: 持久化运行数据目录，用于保存缓存、Cookie 和 SQLite 数据库。";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/ironsbot/data";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"IronsBot Logs";s:6:"Target";s:9:"/app/logs";s:7:"Default";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/ironsbot/logs";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:135:"EN: Persistent file logs. Configure filenames under paths in TOML. ZH: 持久化日志目录，文件名在 TOML 的 paths 中配置。";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/ironsbot/logs";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:15:"IronsBot Config";s:6:"Target";s:7:"/config";s:7:"Default";s:33:"/mnt/user/appdata/ironsbot/config";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:183:"EN: Directory containing the pre-created ironsbot.toml. IronsBot never generates or repairs it. ZH: 存放预先创建的 ironsbot.toml；程序不会自动生成或修复该文件。";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:33:"/mnt/user/appdata/ironsbot/config";}i:4;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"Docker Socket";s:6:"Target";s:20:"/var/run/docker.sock";s:7:"Default";s:20:"/var/run/docker.sock";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:315:"EN: Optional. Enables image checks, container restart/update, and private extension package pulls. This grants control over the host Docker engine. ZH: 可选。用于通过 Docker API 或 Watchtower 检查镜像、重启或更新容器，也用于拉取私有扩展包；挂载后容器可控制宿主机 Docker。";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:20:"/var/run/docker.sock";}i:5;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:20:"IronsBot Config Path";s:6:"Target";s:15:"APP_CONFIG_PATH";s:7:"Default";s:21:"/config/ironsbot.toml";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:91:"EN: Required path to the strict TOML config. ZH: 必填，严格 TOML 配置文件路径。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:21:"/config/ironsbot.toml";}i:6;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:19:"OneBot Access Token";s:6:"Target";s:19:"ONEBOT_ACCESS_TOKEN";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:194:"EN: Required for OneBot/NapCat mode and unused by QQ Official-only mode; it must match NapCat. ZH: OneBot/NapCat 模式必填，仅使用 QQ 官方模式时不使用；必须与 NapCat 一致。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:7;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:14:"OneBot Enabled";s:6:"Target";s:14:"ONEBOT_ENABLED";s:7:"Default";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:178:"EN: Process NapCat events. QQ Official credentials still force NapCat into silent mode. ZH: 是否处理 NapCat 事件；存在 QQ 官方凭据时 NapCat 仍会被强制静默。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"true";}i:8;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:20:"OneBot Send Messages";s:6:"Target";s:20:"ONEBOT_SEND_MESSAGES";s:7:"Default";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:146:"EN: Allow NapCat outbound messages only when no QQ Official credentials exist. ZH: 仅在不存在 QQ 官方凭据时允许 NapCat 发送消息。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"true";}i:9;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:28:"OneBot Identity Verification";s:6:"Target";s:28:"ONEBOT_IDENTITY_VERIFICATION";s:7:"Default";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:332:"EN: Let silent NapCat read the source-message sender referenced by trusted official bot replies. Requires complete official credentials and a trusted bot QQ below. ZH: 让静默 NapCat 读取可信官方机器人回复所引用的原消息发送者，用于群身份关联；需要完整官方凭据和下方的可信机器人 QQ。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:5:"false";}i:10;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:37:"Trusted Official Bot QQ (EXAMPLE_BOT)";s:6:"Target";s:39:"ONEBOT_TRUSTED_OFFICIAL_BOT_EXAMPLE_BOT";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:206:"EN: Numeric QQ of this official bot as seen by NapCat. Rename EXAMPLE_BOT to match the TOML account alias. ZH: NapCat 中看到的该官方机器人数字 QQ；需将 EXAMPLE_BOT 改为 TOML 账号别名。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:11;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:35:"QQ Official AppSecret (AppID 10001)";s:6:"Target";s:16:"APP_SECRET_10001";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:392:"EN: Optional masked AppSecret for the account whose app_id is 10001 in TOML. Change 10001 in both TOML and this variable key to the real public AppID. Add one APP_SECRET_AppID variable per additional bot. ZH: TOML 中 app_id 为 10001 的账号密钥。请将 TOML 与变量名中的 10001 一并改成真实公开 AppID；每增加一个机器人，再添加一个 APP_SECRET_AppID 变量。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:12;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:26:"AI Provider Key (DEEPSEEK)";s:6:"Target";s:15:"AI_KEY_DEEPSEEK";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:90:"EN: Masked key for [ai.providers.deepseek]. ZH: [ai.providers.deepseek] 的加密密钥。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:13;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:23:"AI Provider Key (FUMIN)";s:6:"Target";s:12:"AI_KEY_FUMIN";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:207:"EN: Optional masked key for [ai.providers.fumin]; declare that provider in TOML before filling this value. ZH: 可选，[ai.providers.fumin] 的加密密钥；填写前必须先在 TOML 声明该提供商。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:14;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:24:"AI Provider Key (NOMISS)";s:6:"Target";s:13:"AI_KEY_NOMISS";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:209:"EN: Optional masked key for [ai.providers.nomiss]; declare that provider in TOML before filling this value. ZH: 可选，[ai.providers.nomiss] 的加密密钥；填写前必须先在 TOML 声明该提供商。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:15;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:17:"SendPic CNB Token";s:6:"Target";s:17:"SENDPIC_CNB_TOKEN";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:119:"EN: Optional CNB token for configured SendPic repositories. ZH: 可选，SendPic 使用 CNB 仓库时的访问令牌。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:16;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:21:"GitHub Workflow Token";s:6:"Target";s:21:"GITHUB_WORKFLOW_TOKEN";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:130:"EN: Optional token for operations.data_sync remote builds. ZH: 可选，operations.data_sync 远程构建使用的 GitHub Token。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:17;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:24:"Docker Registry Username";s:6:"Target";s:24:"DOCKER_REGISTRY_USERNAME";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:183:"EN: Optional Docker Hub username for private extension package pulls or private image updates. ZH: 可选。用于拉取私有扩展包或更新私有镜像的 Docker Hub 用户名。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:18;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:21:"Docker Registry Token";s:6:"Target";s:21:"DOCKER_REGISTRY_TOKEN";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:232:"EN: Optional pull-only Docker Hub token for private extension packages or private image updates; never write it in TOML. ZH: 可选。私有扩展包或私有镜像更新使用的 Docker Hub 只读拉取令牌；不要写入 TOML。";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}}s:12:"TemplatePath";s:42:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/templates/ironsbot.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:25:"Murmansk5000's Repository";s:12:"CategoryList";a:1:{i:0;s:15:"Tools-Utilities";}s:16:"ChangeLogPresent";s:1:"1";s:9:"downloads";i:52417;s:13:"downloadtrend";a:3:{i:0;i:33185;i:1;i:40727;i:2;i:52417;}s:8:"trending";d:18.518;s:6:"trends";a:2:{i:0;d:18.518;i:1;d:22.302;}s:10:"trendsDate";a:2:{i:0;i:1789615119;i:1;i:1