hub.com/cloudflare/cloudflared";s:8:"Overview";s:1057:"Cloudflare Tunnel client with built-in Docker healthcheck.

Identical to the official cloudflare/cloudflared image — the only addition is a HEALTHCHECK instruction using the built-in cloudflared tunnel ready command. No files changed, no packages added, no ports opened.

Why this exists: The official image uses a distroless base with no shell (/bin/sh). Docker's --health-cmd always runs through /bin/sh, so healthchecks added via Extra Parameters will always fail. This image bakes the healthcheck in using exec-form, which bypasses the shell.

Setup:
1. Go to Cloudflare Zero Trust dashboard (dash.teams.cloudflare.com)
2. Navigate to Networks > Tunnels > Create a tunnel
3. Select Cloudflared as connector, give it a name
4. Choose Docker as the environment — Cloudflare shows you a token
5. Copy the token and paste it in Post Arguments below, replacing YOUR_TUNNEL_TOKEN_HERE
6. The TUNNEL_METRICS variable is already set — this is required for the healthcheck
7. Start the container — it should show as healthy within 30 seconds";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:90:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ProphetSe7en/unraid-templates/main/cloudflare-tunnel.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:89:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prophetse7en/cloudflare-tunnel/main/cloudflare-icon.png";s:8:"PostArgs";s:57:"tunnel --no-autoupdate run --token YOUR_TUNNEL_TOKEN_HERE";s:6:"Config";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:14:"Tunnel Metrics";s:6:"Target";s:14:"TUNNEL_METRICS";s:7:"Default";s:13:"0.0.0.0:60123";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:141:"Enables the metrics server inside the container. Required for the healthcheck to work. The port is internal only and not exposed to the host.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:13:"0.0.0.0:60123";}}s:12:"TemplatePath";s:41:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/cloudflare-tunnel.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:25:"ProphetSe7en's Repository";s:12:"CategoryList";a:1:{i:0;s:13:"Network-Other";}s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1775481224;s:14:"LastUpdateScan";i:1778080454;s:8:"Category";s:13:"Network:Other";s:2:"ID";i:1037;s:11:"Displayable";b:1;s:6:"Author";s:12:"prophetse7en";s:13:"DockerHubName";s:17:"cloudflare-tunnel";s:8:"RepoName";s:25:"ProphetSe7en's Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:12:"prophetse7en";s:8:"SortName";s:17:"cloudflare tunnel";s:6:"random";i:1369867208;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.0";s:4:"Path";s:127:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/ProphetSe7ensRepository/prophetse7en-cloudflaretunnel-latest.xml";s:4:"Date";N;s:11:"BrandNewApp";b:1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:1038;a:37:{s:4:"Name";s:7:"constat";s:10:"Repository";s:35:"ghcr.io/prophetse7en/constat:latest";s:8:"Registry";s:62:"https://github.com/prophetse7en/constat/pkgs/container/constat";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:4:"bash";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:70:"https://discordapp.com/channels