Setup Instructions:
1. AUTH_SECRET: You MUST enter a long, random string for "Auth Secret". This is required for session security and encryption.
2. FIRST RUN SETUP TOKEN: When you start the container for the first time, check the Container Logs in Unraid. You will find a generated Setup Token there, which is REQUIRED to complete the initial setup wizard in your browser!
3. Setup Wizard: Open the WebUI and enter your Setup Token, Immich URL, API Key, and set your Admin Password during the first-time setup process.
