For enhanced privacy, it can be combined with Tailscale (Unraid 7 and above) for secure remote access and routed through a VPN exit point for IP anonymisation.

Features
	•	Proxy-based search for privacy and simplicity.
	•	Support for multiple search engines and media-specific queries (web, video, images, music, etc.).
	•	No ads or sponsored results.

Setup Recommendations
	•	Combine with Tailscale for secure, remote access.
