Built for households: the admin account (created on first visit) connects Plex and/or Jellyfin plus Sonarr/Radarr, and can add accounts for everyone else. Other household members get the full app - Discover, Search, My Library, Favorites, Calendar - but request titles instead of adding them directly, so nothing downloads without the admin's approval. Includes a release calendar, download notifications, and a mobile-friendly UI.

This is a single, self-contained container - Postgres runs inside it, there is nothing else to install. Just set a POSTGRES_PASSWORD below and go.

