Requires a MySQL 8 or MariaDB database, for example Unraid's "mariadb" template. Create an empty database and a user, then enter the connection in the web UI on first start.

Printing supports 34 Brother P-touch (PT) and QL label printers, from the PT-P750W and PT-P900 series to the QL-500 through QL-1115NWB. After the database setup you create the first account, the administrator; more accounts can be added as administrators or users.";s:5:"WebUI";s:24:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8080]/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:76:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tunefish92/Tapeory/main/unraid/tapeory.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:76:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tunefish92/Tapeory/main/unraid/tapeory.png";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:52:"label labels brother ptouch p-touch lbx printer tape";s:8:"Requires";s:98:"A MySQL 8 or MariaDB database, e.g. the &quot;mariadb&quot; container from Community Applications.";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:10:"Screenshot";a:5:{i:0;s:85:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tunefish92/Tapeory/main/docs/screenshots/editor.png";i:1;s:88:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tunefish92/Tapeory/main/docs/screenshots/templates.png";i:2;s:84:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tunefish92/Tapeory/main/docs/screenshots/print.png";i:3;s:87:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tunefish92/Tapeory/main/docs/screenshots/printers.png";i:4;s:84:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tunefish92/Tapeory/main/docs/screenshots/setup.png";}s:6:"Config";a:6:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8080";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8080";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:46:"Port the Tapeory web UI and API are served on.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8080";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:12:"Storage Path";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/data";s:7:"Default";s:25:"/mnt/user/appdata/tapeory";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:104:"Templates, uploads, rendered labels, backups, and the saved database connection. Back this up regularly.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:25:"