Collection tracking (sports and TCG), grading submission tracking with a profit-
potential ROI calculator, consignment tracking, want lists with shareable public
links, decks/binders, a trade ledger, and sales/profit reporting -- all backed by
a local SQLite database, no cloud account required. Scan cards with a USB webcam
or your phone's browser camera, with barcode/QR scanning for cert numbers and
on-device OCR text extraction. Live card lookup and pricing for Pokemon (TCGdex),
Yu-Gi-Oh (YGOPRODeck), and Magic: The Gathering (Scryfall) -- all free, keyless,
and wired up out of the box. Export your collection to Excel, CSV, or PDF
(including a photo catalog and printable QR label sheets) for use elsewhere, or
