b's Settings page.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}}s:12:"TemplatePath";s:43:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/Ghost-Hub/ghost-hub.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:25:"allornothing's Repository";s:12:"CategoryList";a:2:{i:0;s:15:"Tools-Utilities";i:1;s:8:"Security";}s:16:"ChangeLogPresent";s:1:"1";s:9:"downloads";i:174;s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1791072703;s:10:"LastUpdate";i:1791142771;s:14:"LastUpdateScan";i:1791198847;s:8:"Category";s:25:"Tools:Utilities Security:";s:2:"ID";i:1508;s:11:"Displayable";b:1;s:6:"Author";s:12:"allornothing";s:13:"DockerHubName";s:9:"ghost-hub";s:8:"RepoName";s:25:"allornothing's Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:12:"allornothing";s:8:"SortName";s:9:"Ghost Hub";s:6:"random";i:131643895;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:4:"Path";s:119:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/allornothingsRepository/allornothing-GhostHub-latest.xml";s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:1509;a:40:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"MC-Mod-Hub";s:10:"Repository";s:30:"allornothing/mc-mod-hub:latest";s:8:"Registry";s:48:"https://hub.docker.com/r/allornothing/mc-mod-hub";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:46:"https://github.com/aon082910/mc-mod-hub/issues";s:7:"Project";s:39:"https://github.com/aon082910/mc-mod-hub";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:90:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aon082910/AoN-Unraid-Apps/main/MC-Mod-Hub/mc-mod-hub.xml";s:6:"ReadMe";s:69:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aon082910/mc-mod-hub/main/README.md";s:4:"Icon";s:84:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aon082910/AoN-Unraid-Apps/main/MC-Mod-Hub/icon.png";s:5:"WebUI";s:24:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8080]/";s:8:"Overview";s:2735:"Self-hosted Minecraft mod/addon search hub. Aggregates search results from Modrinth, CurseForge,
PlanetMinecraft, 9Minecraft, BetterBedrock, Hangar (PaperMC's official plugin repo), SpigotMC,
TLMods (TLauncher's mod/modpack/resourcepack/map/shaderpack mirror), MinecraftSkins.net,
Polymart (Spigot/Paper plugin marketplace), GitHub (repos tagged "minecraft", for mods and
plugins with no listing anywhere else), MCreator.net, and McpeDude (Bedrock mods/addons/texture
packs/maps) into one searchable list, styled after
a familiar category-browser layout (category pills, an expandable "newest posts" notice board,
a results table sortable and filterable by every column - name, source, edition, version,
downloads, posted date, and last-updated date).

Every result and every mod detail page shows the required game edition (Java or Bedrock), the
game version(s) it supports, and when available the date it was first posted and last updated -
read directly from each source's own API fields where one publishes them, and best-effort parsed
from listing text on the scraped sites (which don't carry post/update dates at all - shown as a
dash rather than a guess).

Browse by category (Mods, Modpacks, Resource/Texture Packs, Data Packs, Shaders, Maps/Worlds,
Bedrock Add-Ons, Server Plugins, Skins) without typing a search term, via category tiles or the sidebar.

Each mod's detail page also surfaces community discussion pulled from Reddit (since none of these
platforms expose a public reviews API) with heuristic fake-review flags - duplicate text, generic
praise, suspicious posting bursts - and YouTube videos about the mod with download links
automatically extracted from each video's description.

CurseForge and YouTube API keys (both free, both optional but recommended) are entered and changed
from the built-in admin portal after first boot at /admin.html - no file editing required, and no
key ever needs to be baked into the container.

Search results and the notice board are cached (configurable TTL) so repeat searches are instant
and the scraped sites aren't hit on every page load.

Optionally mount your Minecraft server's mods folder at /mods (off by default, one toggle in admin
config) to unlock two more things: an "Install to my server" button on Modrinth/CurseForge/Hangar/
SpigotMC/GitHub results that downloads straight into that folder, and a "My Mods" update checker.
Modrinth/CurseForge are identified by exact content hash (SHA1/murmur2, the same method their own
official apps use, never filename guessing); Hangar/SpigotMC/GitHub have no public hash-lookup API,
so anything installed through this app's own button is instead tracked by recording what was
installed and re-checking that source directly.";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:136:"minecraft mod addon search modrinth curseforge planetminecraft 9minecraft betterbedrock bedrock java edition modpack resourcepack shader";s:8:"Requires";s:230:"Optional but recommended: a free CurseForge API key (console.curseforge.com) and YouTube Data API v3 key (Google Cloud Console) — both entered from the admin portal after first boot, not required to install or run the container.";s:4:"Date";s:10:"2026-09-06";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.9";s:6:"Config";a:5:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8080";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8080";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:26:"Port to access the web UI.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8080";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:4:"Data";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/data";s:7:"Default";s:28:"/mnt/user/appdata/mc-mod-hub";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:95:"Persistent storage for the settings/config database (API keys, source toggles, admin password).";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:28:"/mnt/user/appdata/mc-mod-hub";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:11:"Mods Folder";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/mods";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:220:"Optional: your Minecraft server's mods folder. Only needed for the &quot;Install to my server&quot; button and the update checker (both off by default — enable in admin config after mounting this). Leave blank to skip.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:14:"SESSION_SECRET";s:6:"Target";s:14:"SESSION_SECRET";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:223:"Optional: random string used to sign admin lo