d Quick Sync hardware encoding on any Intel iGPU (Gen 9+) or Arc card. Pass /dev/dri through (preconfigured below) to enable the GPU; without it everything still runs on the CPU. The image ships Intel's media driver — no host driver install needed. Everything runs on this server; no footage leaves your network. Best-effort redaction: always review output before sharing.";s:7:"Support";s:47:"https://github.com/austinmabry/OpenScrub/issues";s:7:"Project";s:40:"https://github.com/austinmabry/OpenScrub";s:6:"ReadMe";s:70:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/austinmabry/OpenScrub/main/README.md";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:90:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/austinmabry/OpenScrub/main/templates/openscrub-intel.xml";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:94:"redaction blur privacy PII PHI face license plate anonymize deface quicksync openvino arc igpu";s:7:"License";s:10:"Apache-2.0";s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.9";s:8:"Requires";s:172:"Optional: an Intel iGPU (Gen 9+) or Arc card for hardware encoding and OpenVINO inference — the /dev/dri device below hands it to the container. Runs CPU-only without it.";s:4:"Date";s:10:"2026-08-05";s:6:"Config";a:6:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8384";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8384";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:116:"HTTPS web interface (self-signed certificate — your browser warns once, or install your own cert in App settings).";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:7:"Appdata";s:6:"Target";s:28:"/root/.local/share/OpenScrub";s:7:"Default";s:27:"/mnt/user/appdata/openscrub";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:206:"Jobs (contains the sensitive uploads and reports!), review decisions, certificates, zones, downloaded models, encryption vault. Everything OpenScrub stores lives here — the container itself is disposable.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";