English: MT Photos is a private photo and video management system for NAS users. It supports importing existing libraries, mobile photo backup, thumbnails, previews, face recognition and location metadata. This template uses mtphotos/mt-photos:nodb-latest, which does not bundle a database. Configure and back up a separate database service.";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:37:"photo photos gallery album backup NAS";s:8:"Requires";s:343:"需要 x86_64 系统及独立 PostgreSQL 服务；人脸识别和以文搜图需要 pgvector 支持。建议系统内存至少 4 GB、双核 2.0 GHz CPU。 English: Requires x86_64 and a separate PostgreSQL service; face recognition and text-to-image search require pgvector support. Recommended: at least 4 GB RAM and a dual-core 2.0 GHz CPU.";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:7:"Support";s:60:"https://github.com/baofeidyz/unraid-template-mtphotos/issues";s:7:"Project";s:18:"https://mtmt.tech/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:101:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/baofeidyz/unraid-template-mtphotos/main/templates/mtphotos-nodb.xml";s:6:"ReadMe";s:83:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/baofeidyz/unraid-template-mtphotos/main/README.md";s:6:"Config";a:11:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:25:"网页端口 / WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8063";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8063";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:135:"MT Photos 网页访问端口，可按需修改宿主机端口。 English: MT Photos web interface port; change the host port if needed.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:21:"配置目录 / Config";s:6:"Target";s:7:"/config";s:7:"Default";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/mtphotos-nodb";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:224:"保存应用配置、缩略图、预览及缓存，请备份此目录。外部数据库需单独备份。 English: Stores settings, thumbnails, previews and cache. Back up this directory and the external database separately.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:21:"上传目录 / Upload";s:6:"Target";s:7:"/upload";s:7:"Default";s:32:"/mnt/user/photos/MTPhotos-Upload";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:175:"保存通过 MT Photos 手机 App 备份的照片和视频，需要可写权限。 English: Writable destination for photos and videos backed up from the MT Photos mobile app.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:21:"图库目录 / Photos";s:6:"Target";s:7:"/photos";s:7:"Default";s:16:"/mnt/user/photos";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:268:"已有照片和视频所在目录，请将宿主机路径改为实际图库路径。如不允许修改原文件，请改为只读模式。 English: Existing photo and video library. Set the host path to your library; use read-only mode to prevent changes to originals.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:4;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:42:"临时目录（可选） / temp (optional)";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/temp";s:7:"Default";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/mtphotos/temp";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:383:"可选的临时文件目录映射，需要可写权限及足够空间。尚未确认 MT Photos 会自动将临时转码文件写入 /temp；仅添加映射不代表转码路径已设置。 English: Optional writable temporary storage with sufficient free space. Automatic use of /temp for transcoding has not been verified; this mapping alone does not configure the transcoding path.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:5;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:17:"时区 / Timezone";s:6:"Target";s:2:"TZ";s:7:"Default";s:13:"Asia/Shanghai";s:11:"Description";s:165:"容器时区，使用 IANA 格式，例如 Asia/Shanghai 或 Europe/London。 English: Container timezone in IANA format, for example Asia/Shanghai or Europe/London.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:6;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:31:"数据库地址 / POSTGRES_HOST";s:6:"Target";s:13:"POSTGRES_HOST";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:325:"必填。bridge 网络请填写 NAS 局域网 IP 和数据库发布端口；使用容器名需加入同一自定义网络。不要填写 localhost 或 127.0.0.1。 English: Required. On bridge, use the NAS LAN IP and published database port. Container names require a shared custom network. Do not use localhost or 127.0.0.1.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:7;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:31:"数据库端口 / POSTGRES_PORT";s:6:"Target";s:13:"POSTGRES_PORT";s:7:"Default";s:4:"5432";s:11:"Description";s:104:"从本容器访问 PostgreSQL 使用的端口。 English: PostgreSQL port reachable from this container.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:8;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:35:"数据库名称 / POSTGRES_DATABASE";s:6:"Target";s:17:"POSTGRES_DATABASE";s:7:"Default";s:8:"postgres";s:11:"Description";s:64:"PostgreSQL 数据库名称。 English: PostgreSQL database name.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:9;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:31:"数据库用户 / POSTGRES_USER";s:6:"Target";s:13:"POSTGRES_USER";s:7:"Default";s:8:"postgres";s:11:"Description";s:53:"PostgreSQL 用户名。 English: PostgreSQL username.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:10;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:35:"数据库密码 / POSTGRES_PASSWORD";s:6:"Target";s:17:"POSTGRES_PASSWORD";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:152:"PostgreSQL 用户密码。本配置不会修改数据库密码。 English: PostgreSQL user password. This setting does not change the database password.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}}s:12:"TemplatePath";s:47:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/templates/mtphotos-nodb.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:22:"baofeidyz's Repository";s:12:"CategoryList";a:2:{i:0;s:15:"MediaAp