alued genre tags when scanning, 'multi' uses the multi-valued tag fields written by tools such as MusicBrainz Picard or beets, 'delim delimiter' splits your single genre tag on a delimiter, e.g. 'delim ;', 'none' disables splitting (default). Note a comma delimiter must be escaped, e.g. 'delim \,', because the environment variable parser splits on comma.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:20;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:34:"Variable: GONIC_MULTI_VALUE_ARTIST";s:6:"Target";s:24:"GONIC_MULTI_VALUE_ARTIST";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:324:"Setting for multi-valued artist tags when scanning, 'multi' uses the multi-valued tag fields, 'delim delimiter' splits your single artist tag on a delimiter, e.g. 'delim ;', 'none' disables splitting (default). Note a comma delimiter must be escaped, e.g. 'delim \,', because the environment variable parser splits on comma.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:21;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:40:"Variable: GONIC_MULTI_VALUE_ALBUM_ARTIST";s:6:"Target";s:30:"GONIC_MULTI_VALUE_ALBUM_ARTIST";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:420:"Setting for multi-valued album artist tags when scanning, 'multi' uses the multi-valued tag fields, 'delim delimiter' splits your single album artist tag on a delimiter, e.g. 'delim ;', 'none' disables splitting (default). Using 'multi' or a delimiter keeps compilation appearances out of your artist list. Note a comma delimiter must be escaped, e.g. 'delim \,', because the environment variable parser splits on comma.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:22;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:32:"Variable: GONIC_MULTI_VALUE_ISRC";s:6:"Target";s:22:"GONIC_MULTI_VALUE_ISRC";s:7:"Default";s:0: