larr' and fill in the corresponding host, port, and API key variables.<br><br>For post-processing (copying completed downloads to a media library), map your library path into this container and set MOVARR_LIBRARY_PATH_LIST to the container path(s).<br><br>IMPORTANT - Please ensure you edit /config/movarr/config/movarr.yml after the initial startup.";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:90:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/binhex/templates/main/unraid/binhex/templates/movarr.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:92:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/binhex/templates/main/unraid/binhex/images/movarr-icon.png";s:4:"Date";s:10:"2026-05-07";s:6:"Config";a:28:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"Path: /config";s:6:"Target";s:7:"/config";s:7:"Default";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/binhex-movarr";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:78:"Container path for movarr configuration file (movarr.yml), database, and logs.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:12:"Path: /media";s:6:"Target";s:6:"/media";s:7:"Default";s:9:"/mnt/user";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:199:"Container path to your media library root. movarr copies completed movies here during post-processing. Set MOVARR_LIBRARY_PATH_LIST to the relevant sub-path(s) inside this mount (e.g. /media/Movies).";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:11:"Path: /data";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/data";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:173:"Container path to the qBittorrent completed downloads directory. movarr reads source files from here during post-processing before calling qBittorrent to remove the torrent.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s: