One container includes the web app and PostgreSQL. Point Games at your existing game share (mounted read-only), keep Appdata on cache/SSD, and open the WebUI to start setup. Your database, settings, generated secrets, and artwork stay in Appdata.

Release 1.1.8 · Multi-architecture image for amd64 and arm64. Optional metadata, workstation artwork, ClamAV, and TRAWL connections are configured by you and off until enabled.

Oneirodex does not include game files, BIOS, firmware, or encryption keys. Use only software you are authorized to access. Install, backup, and update guide: https://github.com/cephyrixzyth/Oneirodex/blob/main/docs/runbooks/Unraid-community-apps.md";s:5:"WebUI";s:24:"http://[IP]:[PORT:5006]/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:92:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cephyrixzyth/unraid-templates/main/oneirodex/oneirodex.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:77:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cephyrixzyth/unraid-templates/main/icon.png";s:10:"Screenshot";a:4:{i:0;s:103:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cephyrixzyth/Oneirodex/main/docs/assets/readme/screenshot-library.png";i:1;s:104:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cephyrixzyth/Oneirodex/main/docs/assets/readme/screenshot-discover.png";i:2;s:107:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cephyrixzyth/Oneirodex/main/docs/assets/readme/screenshot-big-picture.png";i:3;s:111:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cephyrixzyth/Oneirodex/main/docs/assets/readme/screenshot-admin-libraries.png";}s:5:"Video";a:2:{i:0;s:99:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cephyrixzyth/Oneirodex/main/docs/media/video/howto/howto-tour.mp4";i:1;s:110:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cephyrixzyth/Oneirodex/main/docs/media/video/howto/howto-admin-libraries.mp4";}s:11:"ExtraParams";s:25:"--health-start-period=60s";s:6:"Config";a:17:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"5006";s:7:"Default";s:4:"5006";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:14:"Web interface.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"5006";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:7:"Appdata";s:6:"Target";s:7:"/config";s:7:"Default";s:27:"/mnt/user/appdata/oneirodex";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:133:"Database, generated secrets, logs, themes, covers and uploads. Keep this on the cache / an SSD and include it in your appdata backup.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Re