escription";s:68:"Minutes of inactivity before a non-remembered session is logged out.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:3:"120";}i:31;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:18:"OTP Encryption Key";s:6:"Target";s:18:"OTP_ENCRYPTION_KEY";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:309:"Fernet key for encrypting the 2FA TOTP secret at rest. Auto-generated on first start if not set. Set this if you want to manage the key yourself or ensure it survives config volume replacement. Generate with: python3 -c &quot;from cryptography.fernet import Fernet; print(Fernet.generate_key().decode())&quot;";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:32;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"Secret Key";s:6:"Target";s:10:"SECRET_KEY";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:200:"Session signing key. Auto-generated on first start and saved to /app/config/.secret_key. Set this explicitly to ensure sessions survive a full config wipe, or to share a key across multiple instances.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:33;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:18:"Trusted Proxy Hops";s:6:"Target";s:14:"PROXY_FIX_HOPS";s:7:"Default";s:1:"1";s:11:"Description";s:320:"How many reverse-proxy hops to trust when reading X-Forwarded-For. With Cloudflare in front of Traefik in front of this container, set 2 so the login and audit log record the real client. Set 0 to ignore the header entirely. Only count hops you actually control - each trusted hop is one more entry a client could forge.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:1:"1";}i:34;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:8:{s:4:"Name";s:15:"Trusted Proxies";s:6:"Target";s:15:"TRUSTED_PROXIES";s:7:"Default";s