    renames automatically, and lets your users request media Jellyseerr-style. Migrate your existing
    Sonarr/Radarr libraries from Settings > Migrate.

    USE WITH CAUTION ON EXISTING MEDIA LIBRARIES: media-box manages files — it can move, rename,
    upgrade and delete media it imports. If you point it at a library that Sonarr/Radarr or your
    media server already manage, start safe: set Settings > Media Management > File operations
