verview";s:973:"Kokoro-FastAPI is a Dockerized FastAPI wrapper for the Kokoro-82M text-to-speech model, optimized for speed and quality.[br][br]
  
  [b]Features:[/b][br]
  - High-quality Japanese and English text-to-speech.[br]
  - Accelerated inference using NVIDIA GPUs.[br]
  - OpenAI-compatible speech endpoint.[br]
  [br]
  [b]Home Assistant Integration:[/b][br]
  This container is fully compatible with the [b]OpenAI TTS[/b] integration in Home Assistant. You can generate local, OpenAI-level quality voice audio using your own GPU.[br]
  1. Install the OpenAI TTS integration (via HACS).[br]
  2. Set the "API Key" to any random text (e.g., "123").[br]
  3. Set the "Target URL" to: [b]http://[IP]:8880/v1[/b][br]
  [br]
  [b]Requirements:[/b][br]
  - Requires the [b]Nvidia Driver[/b] plugin.[br]
