";s:7:"Support";s:57:"https://github.com/finalbillybong/Kitchen-cupboard/issues";s:7:"Project";s:50:"https://github.com/finalbillybong/Kitchen-cupboard";s:8:"Overview";s:904:"Kitchen Cupboard is a self-hosted recipe library, weekly meal planner and collaborative shopping list for households. Share recipes, ratings, a regular-purchase Basics checklist and pantry flags; plan batch cooking and leftovers, then review combined ingredients before adding them to shopping. Includes real-time list updates, recipe website imports, text/PDF/CSV exports and a mobile-friendly PWA with offline shopping-item edits. Photo extraction through a configured vision provider and one-way Nextcloud calendar sync are optional. Recipes and planning are shared across all active accounts; shopping lists have separate sharing permissions. This is a beta, and the latest image follows main. Set a random SECRET_KEY before starting, then create the first admin account locally; later registrations require invitations by default. HTTPS is needed for browser PWA/offline support except on localhost.";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:74:"recipes cooking groceries shopping meal planner pantry household nextcloud";s:8:"Requires";s:101:"x86-64 (linux/amd64). Persistent storage at /app/data. A random SECRET_KEY of at least 32 characters.";s:5:"WebUI";s:23:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8000]";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:91:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/finalbillybong/unraid-templates/main/kitchen-cupboard.xml";s:6:"ReadMe";s:80:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/finalbillybong/Kitchen-cupboard/main/README.md";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:4:"Icon";s:99:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/finalbillybong/Kitchen-cupboard/main/frontend/public/icon-512.png";s:11:"ExtraParams";s:24:"--restart=unless-stopped";s:6:"Config";a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:11:"Web UI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8000";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8111";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:27:"Port for the web interface.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"D