SETUP — nothing else is required in this template. Install, open the WebUI, then:
1. Sign in with Plex (PIN-based, no password typed here). The FIRST Plex account to sign in becomes the permanent owner of this instance, so do this before exposing the port.
2. Pick your Plex server and libraries.
