 restyled to match, and Pinned Apps and Installed Apps are rendered by the plugin. Star counts are read from the public GitHub API using a personal access token you supply, and are fetched only for the apps on screen, so browsing fills the catalog in gradually rather than hammering the API. A toggle in the toolbar switches back to the stock Community Applications view at any time, and uninstalling the plugin restores the Apps page exactly as it was.";s:9:"PluginURL";s:88:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghzgod/unraid-modern-appstore/main/modern.appstore.plg";s:12:"PluginAuthor";s:6:"ghzgod";s:7:"Project";s:48:"https://github.com/ghzgod/unraid-modern-appstore";s:6:"ReadMe";s:78:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghzgod/unraid-modern-appstore/main/README.md";s:4:"Icon";s:77:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghzgod/unraid-modern-appstore/main/icon.png";s:6:"IconFA";s:4:"star";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:93:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghzgod/unraid-ca-templates/main/plugins/modern.appstore.xml";s:12:"TemplatePath";s:47:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/plugins/modern.appstore.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:19:"ghzgod's Repository";s:10:"Repository";s:88:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghzgod/unraid-modern-appstore/main/modern.appstore.plg";s:12:"CategoryList";a:2:{i:0;s:15:"Tools-Utilities";i:1;s:7:"Plugins";}s:6:"Plugin";b:1;s:7:"Support";s:48:"https://github.com/ghzgod/unraid-modern-appstore";s:13:"pluginVersion";s:10:"2026.09.09";s:6:"MinVer";s:4:"6.12";s:6:"Author";s:6:"ghzgod";s:16:"ChangeLogPresent";s:1:"1";s:11:"hideFromWeb";b:0;s:9:"CAComment";s:114:"There may be issues with Community Applications (Apps) with this plugin installed, even if it&apos;s not enabled  ";s:9:"downloads";i:412;s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1786375458;s:14:"LastUpdateScan";i:1792383193;s:11:"pluginStats";a:13:{i:10;i:22;i:11;i:0;i:12;i:0;s:2:"01";i:0;s:2:"02";i:0;s:2:"03";i:0;s:2:"04";i:0;s:2:"05";i:0;s:2:"06";i:0;s:2:"07";i:0;s:2:"08";i:309;s:2:"09";i:81;s:1:"T";i:412;}s:8:"Category";s:24:"Tool