iable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:24;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:28:"eBay Client Secret (Cert ID)";s:6:"Target";s:18:"EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:62:"eBay Cert ID (Client Secret) that pairs with the App ID above.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:25;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:16:"eBay Marketplace";s:6:"Target";s:19:"EBAY_MARKETPLACE_ID";s:7:"Default";s:7:"EBAY_DE";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:122:"Which eBay site/currency to price against: EBAY_DE (EUR), EBAY_FR (EUR), EBAY_GB (GBP), EBAY_US (USD), EBAY_IT, EBAY_ES…";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:7:"EBAY_DE";}i:26;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:17:"Steam Web API key";s:6:"Target";s:13:"STEAM_API_KEY";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:204:"Optional: import your owned Steam games via Add → Steam. Get a free key at https://steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey. Your Steam profile's Game details must be Public. Can also be set in the app's Settings.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:27;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:18:"Valuation Currency";s:6:"Target";s:18:"VALUATION_CURRENCY";s:7:"Default";s:3:"EUR";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:59:"Currency for Discogs marketplace prices (EUR, USD, GBP…).";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:3:"EUR";}}s:12:"TemplatePath";s:45:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/templates/media-vault.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:22:"halvar100's Repository";s:12:"CategoryList";a:3:{i:0;s:14:"MediaApp-Video";i:1;s:14:"MediaApp-Music";i:2;s:14:"MediaApp-Other";}s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1786375458;s:8:"Category";s:44:"MediaApp:Video MediaApp:Music MediaApp:Other";s:2:"ID";i:2168;s:11:"Displayable";b:1;s:6:"Author";s:11:"halvar20000";s:13:"DockerHubName";s:11:"media-vault";s:8:"RepoName";s:22:"halvar100's Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:11:"halvar20000";s:8:"SortName";s:11:"media vault";s:6:"random";i:233022290;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.0";s:4:"Path";s:117:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/halvar100sRepository/halvar20000-mediavault-latest.xml";s:4:"Date";N;s:11:"BrandNewApp";b:1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:2169;a:35:{s:4:"Name";s:16:"wealth-dashboard";s:10:"Repository";s:43:"ghcr.io/halvar20000/wealth-dashboard:latest";s:8:"Registry";s:79:"https://github.com/halvar20000/wealth-dashboard/pkgs/container/wealth-dashboard";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:54:"https://github.com/halvar20000/wealth-dashboard/issues";s:7:"Project";s:47:"https://github.com/halvar20000/wealth-dashboard";s:8:"Overview";s:1774:"Self-hosted net worth tracking. One SQLite file on your own server — no account with anybody, no telemetry, and no cloud component that could be switched off.

⚙ Nothing to configure to start: set a port, keep the Data path on appdata, apply, then open the WebUI and create your login. That login is the only one, and it lives in your database.

🌐 English, German, French and Spanish — including the way numbers and dates are written. It follows your browser unless you pick one under Settings.

📊 What it does: accounts you enter by hand, broker CSV import (Degiro and Trade Republic, recognised by their columns), holdings computed from those trades, and an overview with net worth, cash against securities, cash flow, budgets, detected subscriptions, transactions and categories that learn a rule once and apply it retroactively.

🏦 Optional bank sync over PSD2 via Enable Banking (a few thousand banks across the EEA). You register your own application with them, so the consent is between you and your bank — nothing passes through a server belonging to whoever wrote this. Read-only: the app cannot move money. Set it up later in the app under Settings; it is not needed to start.

💾 Everything you own is under /data — the database, your settings, and in /data/secrets the bank credentials and the key that signs your sessions. Map it to appdata and it survives updates. Back that folder up: there is no password reset, because there is nobody to reset it.

⚠ It holds your finances and it has one password. Keep it on your LAN, or behind your own reverse proxy and access control — do not port-forward it to the internet.

📖 Install and setup guide: https://github.com/halvar20000/wealth-dashboard/blob/main/docs/INSTALL.md";s:5:"WebUI";s:23:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8000]";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:98:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/halvar20000/wealth-dashboard/main/templates/wealth-dashboard.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:76:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/halvar20000/wealth-dashboard/main/icon.png";s:8:"Requires";s:367:"Nothing. No database container, no API key, no account anywhere — a browser is all that is needed to use it.<br><br>Bank sync is optional and set up inside the app afterwards: it needs a free Enable Banking application (your own application ID and private key) and a bank in the EEA. Broker import, manual accounts and every page of the dashboard work without it.";s:6:"Config";a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8000";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8000";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:148:"Port the dashboard is reached on. If you change it, and you use bank sync, the Redirect URL registered with Enable Banking has to match the new one.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8000";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:4:"Data";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/data";s:7:"Default";s:34:"/mnt/user/appdata/wealth-dashboard";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:250:"Everything you own: the database, your settings, and /data/secrets holding the Enable Banking private key and the key that signs your sessions. Keep it on appdata and back it up — there is no password reset and no copy of any of this anywhere else.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:34:"/mnt/user/appdata/wealth-dashboard";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:8:"Timezone";s:6:"Target";s:2:"TZ";s:7:"Default";s:13:"Europe/Berlin";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:195:"Your timezone, e.g. Europe/Berlin, Europe/London, America/New_York. It decides when a month rolls over for the cash flow and budget pages. Leave it wrong and 'this month' changes at UTC midnight.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:13:"Europe/Berlin";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:4:"PUID";s:6:"Target";s:4:"PUID";s:7:"Default";s:2:"99";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:187:"The user the app runs as. It is given the Data folder on every start, so files there are yours (nobody:users, like the other containers) and the process holding your finances is not root.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:2:"99";}i:4;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:4:"PGID";s:6:"Target";s:4:"PGID";s:7:"Default";s:3:"100";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:26:"The group the app runs as.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:3:"100";}i:5;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:24:"Base currency (optional)";s:6:"Target";s:16:"WD_BASE_CURRENCY";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:198:"Leave BLANK — set the base currency in the app under Settings. Filling this in pins the value: the Settings page will accept a change and the container will overwrite it again on the next restart.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:6;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:28:"Bank redirect URL (optional)";s:6:"Target";s:15:"WD_REDIRECT_URL";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:354:"Leave BLANK — set it in the app under Settings, where it can be checked against what Enable Banking has registered. Filling this in pins the value the same way as the base currency above. For reference the value looks like http://YOUR-SERVER-IP:8000/connect/callback an