s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:49:"https://github.com/jlightner86/jellylooter/issues";s:7:"Project";s:42:"https://github.com/jlightner86/jellylooter";s:8:"Overview";s:2099:"JellyLooter v3.1.0 - Sync media from remote Jellyfin/Emby servers to local storage.
        NEW in v3.2.0:
        - External API access (NZB360, Organizr, Home Assistant compatible)
        - 6 Dashboard layouts (Classic, Compact, Cards, List, Minimal, Large)
        - Redesigned tabbed Settings UI
        - Per-server workers (Pro) - download from multiple servers simultaneously
        - Resource limits (Pro) - CPU threads, process priority, I/O priority
        - Enhanced download statistics with per-server breakdown
        FREE Features:
        - Browse and download from 2 remote servers
        - Library search - find movies/shows by name
        - Duplicate detection with local library scanning
        - Rating overlays on posters (IMDB/TMDB ratings)
        - Quality badges (4K, 1080p, HDR, Dolby Vision, Atmos)
        - Content rating badges (PG-13, R, TV-MA)
        - Time format option (12-hour or 24-hour)
        - 30+ timezone options
        - Mobile-friendly responsive UI with hamburger menu
        - Download history, search/filter, keyboard shortcuts
        - Auto-retry failed downloads
        - Multi-language support (English, Spanish, German)
        PRO Features ($10 lifetime):
        - Unlimited servers and sync mappings
        - Per-server workers - each server gets dedicated download pool
        - Resource limits - control CPU, I/O, memory for NAS/low-power devices
        - Notifications (Discord, Telegram, 80+ services)
        - GPU transcoding (NVIDIA NVENC, Intel QuickSync, AMD VAAPI)
        - Transcoding presets: H.264, H.265/HEVC, AVI, Mobile, 4K Optimized
        - Transcode cache drive support (use fast SSD)
        - Download and bandwidth scheduling
        - *arr integration (Sonarr/Radarr auto-add and folder naming)
        - Intelligent path mapping auto-detection
        - Custom themes (Jellyfin, Plex, Emby, Christmas, Custom)
        - Multiple local servers for duplicate detection
        - Analytics dashboard
