to-text.

This image is built from nousresearch/hermes-agent:latest with faster-whisper and its CUDA runtime wheels (nvidia-cudnn-cu12, nvidia-cublas-cu12) added on top.
No separate CUDA toolkit installation is required on the host — GPU acceleration works out of the box with the NVIDIA Unraid plugin.

It exposes the Dashboard WebUI on port 9119 and API access on port 8642.
A custom Docker network and a shared volume are used so the other Hermes templates can see this container.

Please see https://github.com/lbouriez/Unraid-Templates for deployment notes.
Refer to https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/user-guide/docker for full Hermes configuration options.

WHISPER_MODEL controls the model size (tiny / base / small / medium / large-v3).
Larger models are slower to load but more accurate. Start with "small" unless you have ample VRAM.

