Install Instructions:
1. Run the commands outlined under "Additional Requirements".
2. Place your config.yml file under /mnt/user/appdata/flexget/config or use the example file from https://github.com/logandwaters/Unraid-docker-templates/blob/main/flexget/example-config.yml
