s-Utilities";}s:16:"ChangeLogPresent";s:1:"1";s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1789271142;s:8:"Category";s:19:"AI: Tools:Utilities";s:2:"ID";i:3239;s:11:"Displayable";b:0;s:6:"Author";s:7:"0xshug0";s:13:"DockerHubName";s:9:"audio-cpp";s:8:"RepoName";s:20:"lozenge's Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:7:"0xshug0";s:8:"SortName";s:9:"audio cpp";s:6:"random";i:570839291;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.0";s:4:"Path";s:71:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/3239.xml";s:4:"Date";N;s:11:"BrandNewApp";b:1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:13:"BranchDefault";s:8:"full-cpu";s:8:"BranchID";a:2:{i:0;i:3237;i:1;i:3238;}s:10:"BranchName";s:11:"full-vulkan";s:17:"BranchDescription";s:71:"AMD / Intel — Vulkan; upstream rolling image; not yet hardware-tested";s:11:"Description";N;s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:3240;a:42:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"MoviePilot-V3";s:10:"Repository";s:20:"jxxghp/moviepilot-v3";s:8:"Registry";s:45:"https://hub.docker.com/r/jxxghp/moviepilot-v3";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:4:"bash";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:61:"https://forums.unraid.net/topic/184591-support-moviepilot-v3/";s:7:"Project";s:36:"https://github.com/jxxghp/MoviePilot";s:8:"Overview";s:2080:"MoviePilot V3 is an automation hub for a home media library. It watches your subscriptions, searches your indexers, hands the release to your existing BitTorrent client, then renames, hardlinks and scrapes the finished files into a clean library and refreshes your media server.[br][br]
  Highlights:[br]
  - Subscribe to movies and TV shows and let MoviePilot find and download them automatically.[br]
  - Works with your existing downloaders, media servers, metadata sources and notification channels.[br]
  - Automatic organising: renaming, hardlinking, NFO/artwork scraping and media server refresh.[br]
  - Plugin and workflow system for extending behaviour without touching the core.[br][br]
  Setup notes:[br]
  - The web UI runs on port 3000. On first start open it and complete the setup wizard.[br]
  - Map /media and /downloads under the same Unraid share (for example /mnt/user/) so hardlinks work instead of copies.[br]
  - Settings live in /config/app.env and can also be edited from the web UI.[br][br]
  Documentation: https://wiki.movie-pilot.org[br]
  Project home: https://movie-pilot.org[br][br]
  This template is community maintained and is not produced by the MoviePilot authors. Support requests for the template belong in the Unraid support thread; bugs in MoviePilot itself belong upstream.[br][br]
  ===== 简体中文 =====[br]
  MoviePilot V3 是一款面向家庭影音库的自动化管理工具：自动订阅、搜索资源、调用已有的 BT 下载器下载，下载完成后自动重命名、硬链接、刮削元数据并通知媒体服务器刷新。[br][br]
  使用提示：[br]
  - Web 界面端口为 3000，首次启动后打开页面完成初始化向导。[br]
  - /media 与 /downloads 请映射到同一个 Unraid 共享（例如 /mnt/user/）下，否则无法硬链接，只能复制。[br]
