The idea for this app came from using my Hobonichi Techo planner every morning to write down what I needed to accomplish that day & using it for scratching down random thoughts and notes as the day went on. The closest thing I've seen to an app for replacing this system is Noteplan, but I don't use a Mac or an iOS device, and it's not self-hostable, so I decided to write my own.
Since I had the need for keeping track of to-dos throughout the day, regular Markdown didn't work for me since it doesn't natively support tasks. So as an alternative I'm using Github Flavored Markdown (GFM). I really wanted it to feel like an actual text editor and not just a textbox, so I decided to use CodeMirror to handle all the input. Fira Code is used to provide font ligatures. Some other nice features include code highlighting, text/code folding, and a task list where you can toggle the status of any task from any date or note.";s:5:"WebUI";s:24:"http://[IP]:[PORT:5000]/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:73:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/m0ngr31/unraid_ca/master/DailyNotes.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:31:"https://i.imgur.com/AI8bd73.png";s:10:"Networking";a:1:{s:4:"Mode";s:6:"bridge";}s:6:"Config";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"App Config";s:6:"Target";s:11:"/app/config";s:7:"Default";s:28:"/mnt/user/appdata/dailynotes";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:0:"";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:28:"/mnt/user/appdata/dailynotes";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:14:"Container Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"5000";s:7:"Default";s:4:"5000";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:0:"";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"5000";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:16:"Prevent Signups?";s:6:"Target";s:15:"PREVENT_SIGNUPS";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:68:"Disable signup form? Anything in this variable will prevent signups.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}}s:12:"TemplatePath";s:34:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/DailyNotes.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:20:"m0ngr31's Repository";s:12:"CategoryList";a:1:{i:0;s:18:"AI-Tools-Utilities";}s:5:"stars";i:9;s:9:"downloads";i:115258;s:13:"downl