Before the first start:
- Install a PostgreSQL container (for example the official postgres:16 image) and create a database and user for Nametag.
- Generate the two secrets in the Unraid terminal with: openssl rand -base64 32
- Run: mkdir -p /mnt/user/appdata/nametag/photos && chown -R 1001:1001 /mnt/user/appdata/nametag (the container runs as UID 1001).

