Manual:
After installing the Dropbox container
- open the container overview
- click on the logs icon
- wait until you are prompted to visit a Dropbox URL
- Copy and Paste the URL and link the container with your Dropbox account
- the container automatically starts syncing

IMPORTANT:
The official Dropbox client (which is used in this container) does not support FUSE filesystems. Because of that its NOT possible to use the path "/mnt/user" as your user file path. You MUST use one of these direct disk paths:

If your Dropbox share has the cache setting "No":
/mnt/disk1/Dropbox

If your "Dropbox" share has the cache setting "Only":
/mnt/cache/Dropbox

