;i:3420;s:11:"Displayable";b:1;s:6:"Author";s:8:"mmenanno";s:13:"DockerHubName";s:16:"redditchatbridge";s:8:"RepoName";s:21:"mmenanno's Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:8:"mmenanno";s:8:"SortName";s:16:"RedditChatBridge";s:6:"random";i:753234413;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.0";s:4:"Path";s:119:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/mmenannosRepository/mmenanno-RedditChatBridge-latest.xml";s:4:"Date";N;s:11:"BrandNewApp";b:1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"DonateText";s:15:"Buy me a coffee";s:10:"DonateLink";s:33:"https://buymeacoffee.com/mmenanno";s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:3421;a:37:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"modelship-cpu";s:10:"Repository";s:41:"ghcr.io/modelship-ai/modelship:latest-cpu";s:8:"Registry";s:38:"https://ghcr.io/modelship-ai/modelship";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:48:"https://github.com/modelship-ai/modelship/issues";s:7:"Project";s:41:"https://github.com/modelship-ai/modelship";s:8:"Overview";s:1355:"Self-hosted, OpenAI-compatible inference for the agentic era. Modelship runs your whole AI stack -- reasoning LLMs with universal tool calling, embeddings, speech-to-text, text-to-speech, and image generation -- as multiple models sharing your CPU behind a single OpenAI-compatible gateway. Built on Ray Serve with pluggable backends (llama.cpp, vLLM, Diffusers, plugins).

This is the CPU-only variant -- no GPU or NVIDIA Container Toolkit needed, works on any box (amd64 or arm64, including Apple Silicon hosts). For GPU support instead, use the separate "modelship-cuda" template.

IMPORTANT: modelship does not authenticate callers -- anyone who can reach the API port can use it. Do not expose it beyond a trusted network without an authenticating reverse proxy in front.

