ublic/emby-insights-logo.png";s:5:"WebUI";s:23:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8080]";s:8:"Overview";s:1080:"Emby Insights is a personal, mobile-first media dashboard for Emby users. It complements the
Emby player instead of replacing it: personal playback statistics (genres, weekdays, watch
hours, longest sessions, most active days), a detail view per title, recently watched content,
recommendations, upcoming movies/shows, and optional media requests via Seerr — all in one
place, backed by the user's normal Emby login.

The first Emby account to log in via the dashboard is automatically made the Emby Insights
admin and configures everything else (library selection, optional Seerr/Radarr/Sonarr/TMDB/OMDB
integrations) from the Verwaltung/Admin screen at runtime — no container restart needed.

This is an all-in-one image: the Emby Insights backend, PostgreSQL, and Redis all run inside
this single container, persisted under /config. For personal playback statistics you also need
the companion Emby Insights Plugin installed on your Emby server:
