ork";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:59:"https://github.com/mygrexit/payback-coupon-activator/issues";s:7:"Project";s:52:"https://github.com/mygrexit/payback-coupon-activator";s:6:"ReadMe";s:59:"https://github.com/mygrexit/payback-coupon-activator#readme";s:8:"Overview";s:1099:"Activates every pending coupon in your PAYBACK account once or several times a day, using headless Chromium and the cookies of a browser session you export yourself.

It never types your password and never solves or bypasses bot checks. When a person is needed, it stops and notifies you (Pushover, Telegram, ntfy, Gotify, ... via shoutrrr).

**Setup**
1. Log in at payback.de in your desktop browser.
2. Export the cookies with the "Cookie-Editor" extension (Export - JSON).
3. Save them as cookies.json in the data folder of this container.

The cookie file grants full access to your PAYBACK account. Treat it like a password. Without it the container keeps running and reports "session expired".

**Notifications**
There is no web interface; the status is in the container log. You get a notification when the session expires, a bot check appears, the page layout changed or coupons could not be activated.

**Disclaimer**
