Choose a [b]Password[/b] (user name [i]admin[/i]); leave it empty and a random password is printed once in the container log. Then open the WebUI: JusttPrint asks which folders hold your models and scans them. Change them later under Settings, Scanning, STL Home.[br][br]
[b]Unraid Shares[/b] makes your shares visible at the same paths (/mnt/user/...), read and write, so delete, move and Organize Library work. Unraid's own shares (appdata, system, domains, isos) are never scanned or shown. To limit JusttPrint to one share, set both the host path and the container path to it, for example /mnt/user/models.[br][br]
Settings given here win over the web UI on every start; leave one empty to set it in the web UI instead.[br][br]
[b]NVIDIA GPU (optional, faster thumbnails):[/b] with the Nvidia Driver plugin, add --runtime=nvidia to Extra Parameters and the variables NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=all and NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=graphics,compute,utility.";s:5:"WebUI";s:24:"http://[IP]:[PORT:5000]/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:80:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngolston/JusttPrint/main/unraid/justtprint.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:82:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ngolston/JusttPrint/main/assets/pwa-icon-512.png";s:11:"ExtraParams";s:35:"--memory=8g --memory-reservation=1g";s:6:"Config";a:22:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"5000";s:7:"Default";s:4:"5000";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:27:"Port for the web interface.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"5000";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:8:"App Data";s:6:"Target";s:24:"/root/.config/justtprint";s:7:"Default";s:28:"/mnt/user/appdata/justtprint";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:84:"Database, thumbnails, settings and backups. Keep this folder: it holds your library.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:28:"/mnt/user/appdata/justtprint";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"Unraid Shares";s:6:"Target";s:9:"/mnt/user";s:7:"Default";s:9:"/mnt/user";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:201:"Your shares, at the same paths inside the container; pick the model folders in the web UI. For one share only, change BOTH paths to it, for example host /mnt/user/models and container /mnt/user/models.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:9:"/mnt/user";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:8:"Password";s:6:"Target";s:19:"JUSTTPRINT_PASSWORD";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:153:"Password of the admin account, appli