ortAuthor";s:8:"petersem";s:8:"SortName";s:7:"posterr";s:6:"random";i:1044984165;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.0";s:4:"Path";s:110:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/petersemsRepository/petersem-posterr-latest.xml";s:4:"Date";N;s:11:"BrandNewApp";b:1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"trendDelta";d:2.236;s:12:"trendAverage";d:2.6689;s:10:"DonateText";s:45:"If you like my work please consider Donating.";s:10:"DonateLink";s:40:"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/thanksmp";s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:4223;a:36:{s:4:"Name";s:5:"Groly";s:10:"Repository";s:34:"ghcr.io/peterthepeter/groly:latest";s:8:"Registry";s:35:"https://ghcr.io/peterthepeter/groly";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:45:"https://github.com/peterthepeter/groly/issues";s:7:"Project";s:38:"https://github.com/peterthepeter/groly";s:8:"Overview";s:1518:"Groly is a self-hosted app for grocery lists, recipes, meal planning, and health and nutrition tracking. Navigation and main actions sit at the bottom of the mobile interface, within thumb reach, so you can quickly add and check off shopping items. Use it in a browser or add it to your home screen as a PWA on iOS or Android.

Features: Shopping lists work offline and sync when you reconnect. Share lists with other users to shop together, with changes synced in real time. Other features include barcode scanning, category sorting, location-based list opening, recipe imports, weekly meal planning, calorie and macro tracking with Open Food Facts, supplements with nutrient totals and stock tracking, water, caffeine, mood, and meditation trackers, reminders, history views, and more.

Users: The admin invites users via a one-time link (Menu → Users → Add User). Each user sets their own password; there is no public registration.

⚠️ HTTPS is required, including on your local network. Offline mode, PWA installation, push notifications, barcode scanning, and location-based list opening will not work without it. Use a reverse proxy (Nginx Proxy Manager, Caddy, Traefik) or Tailscale to provide HTTPS.

Push notifications are optional. Leave VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY, VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY, PUBLIC_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY, and VAPID_SUBJECT empty to start without push. To enable it later, configure these variables and turn on notifications in Settings.

