://github.com/snellejelle99/caddy-modular/discussions";s:7:"Project";s:24:"https://caddyserver.com/";s:6:"ReadMe";s:66:"https://github.com/snellejelle99/caddy-modular/blob/main/README.md";s:7:"License";s:10:"Apache-2.0";s:8:"Overview";s:1046:"This container builds and runs the latest version of Caddy with the specified modules included. 
