GPU setup (without it, Video2X falls back to the CPU and is extremely slow):
- NVIDIA: install the Nvidia-Driver plugin, then add "--gpus all" to Extra Parameters (advanced view).
- Intel/AMD: set the "Intel/AMD GPU" device to /dev/dri.
Both can be used together. Tested on RTX 3090 and RTX 5060 Ti.

The web UI has no login: anyone who can reach the port can upload, start jobs and delete logs. Keep it on your LAN or behind a reverse proxy with authentication.

