st";s:8:"Registry";s:41:"https://ghcr.io/stoatworks-labs/wallslide";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:51:"https://github.com/stoatworks-labs/wallslide/issues";s:7:"Project";s:44:"https://github.com/stoatworks-labs/wallslide";s:8:"Overview";s:194:"Generates correctly sized, themed PowerPoint and Keynote templates and test decks for an LED wall, working out the build scale the application will actually accept. Runs entirely in the browser.";s:5:"WebUI";s:22:"http://[IP]:[PORT:80]/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:96:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stoatworks-labs/stoatworks-unraid/main/templates/wallslide.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:81:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stoatworks-labs/stoatworks-unraid/main/icon.png";s:6:"Config";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:2:"80";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8543";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:32:"Host port for the web interface.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8543";}}s:12:"TemplatePath";s:43:"/tmp/GitHub/AppFeed/templates/wallslide.xml";s:4:"Repo";s:27:"Stoatworks Labs' Repository";s:12:"CategoryList";a:2:{i:0;s:14:"MediaApp-Video";i:1;s:15:"Tools-Utilities";}s:9:"FirstSeen";i:1788797528;s:8:"Category";s:30:"MediaApp:Video Tools:Utilities";s:2:"ID";i:4651;s:11:"Displayable";b:1;s:6:"Author";s:15:"stoatworks-labs";s:13:"DockerHubName";s:9:"wallslide";s:8:"RepoName";s:27:"Stoatworks Labs' Repository";s:10:"SortAuthor";s:15:"stoatworks-labs";s:8:"SortName";s:9:"wallslide";s:6:"random";i:282570036;s:9:"Blacklist";b:0;s:6:"MinVer";s:3:"6.0";s:4:"Path";s:123:"/tmp/community.applications/tempFiles/templates-community-apps/StoatworksLabsRepository/stoatworkslabs-wallslide-latest.xml";s:4:"Date";N;s:11:"BrandNewApp";b:1;s:10:"Deprecated";b:0;s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:4652;a:35:{s:4:"Name";s:9:"weblinked";s:10:"Repository";s:38:"ghcr.io/stoatworks-labs/weblinked:edge";s:8:"Registry";s:41:"https://ghcr.io/stoatworks-labs/weblinked";s:7:"Network";s:4:"host";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:51:"https://github.com/stoatworks-labs/weblinked/issues";s:7:"Project";s:44:"https://github.com/stoatworks-labs/weblinked";s:8:"Overview";s:1922:"Renders a web page offscreen at a broadcast raster and exact frame rate and sends it out as NDI. Point it at a Grafana dashboard, a scoreboard, a lower third or a countdown clock and it becomes a video source your vision mixer, decoder or recorder can take.

Chromium renders on the CPU through SwiftShader, so no GPU passthrough is needed. Measured at 50.1 ticks/sec at 1080p50 with zero dropped frames.

IMPORTANT — the NDI runtime is not included and you must supply it. libndi is loaded at run time and its licence does not permit redistribution under MIT, so it cannot be shipped in the image. Download the NDI SDK for Linux from ndi.video, take libndi.so.6 out of lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/, put it in the "NDI runtime" path below, and restart the container. Without it everything still runs and the NDI output simply reports itself unavailable.

This container uses host networking because NDI discovery is mDNS, which Docker's bridge network does not forward. In bridge mode the source is never seen by any receiver and nothing reports an error.

SDI output is not available in a container: DeckLink and AJA need a card and a kernel driver on the host. Syphon and Spout are macOS and Windows only.

The control page is at the WebUI link and is the whole interface — it also accepts HTTP and OSC from Companion or a show-control system.

SECURITY: intended to run purely inside a private network or Tailscale tailnet. The control API has no authentication until you set an API token, and POST /api/script runs arbitrary JavaScript in the rendered page — so an open port here is remote code execution in a browser on your network, not just a feed a stranger can retune. Its security has not been independently reviewed by a human. Host networking puts the control port on every interface this server has, so set the bind address to your tailnet address, set an API token, and never expose it to the public internet.";s:5:"WebUI";s:17:"http://[IP]:7654/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:96:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stoatworks-labs/stoatworks-unraid/main/templates/weblinked.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:81:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stoatworks-labs/stoatworks-unraid/main/icon.png";s:8:"Requires";s:101:"The NDI runtime is not bundled — see the note about libndi above. Everything else works without it.";s:6:"Config";a:12:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:8:"Page URL";s:6:"Target";s:13:"WEBLINKED_URL";s:7:"Default";s:19:"https://example.com";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:185:"The page to render. For Grafana, use a public dashboard link and add &amp;kiosk to drop the surrounding UI — an offscreen browser cannot be typed into, so the page must need no login.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:19:"https://example.com";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:12:"Video format";s:6:"Target";s:16:"WEBLINKED_FORMAT";s:7:"Default";s:7:"1080p50";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:135:"Raster and exact frame rate, for example 1080p50, 720p59.94 or 1920x1080i25. Rates are exact rationals: 59.94 is 60000/1001, not 59.94.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:7:"1080p50";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:15:"NDI source name";s:6:"Target";s:18:"WEBLINKED_NDI_NAME";s:7:"Default";s:9:"WebLinked";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:88:"The name this appears as on the network. Leave empty to disable the NDI output entirely.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:9:"WebLinked";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:11:"NDI runtime";s:6:"Target";s:12:"/opt/ndi/lib";s:7:"Default";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/weblinked/ndi";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"ro";s:11:"Description";s:225:"A directory on the host containing libndi.so.6 from the NDI SDK for Linux, which you download and licence yourself. Mounted read-only. If this is empty the container still starts and the NDI output reports itself unavailable.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/weblinked/ndi";}i:4;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"Browser cache";s:6:"Target";s:6:"/cache";s:7:"Default";s:33:"/mnt/user/appdata/weblinked/cache";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:154:"Persists cookies and site storage across restarts. Two containers must never share one directory — Chromium locks it, and the second to start will fail.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:33:"/mnt/user/appdata/weblinked/cache";}i:5;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:25:"Cache path (in container)";s:6:"Target";s:15:"WEBLINKED_CACHE";s:7:"Default";s:6:"/cache";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:131:"Tells WebLinked to use the mounted cache directory. Clear this to keep cookies and storage in memory instead, discarded on restart.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:6:"/cache";}i:6;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:12:"Control port";s:6:"Target";s:14:"WEBLINKED_PORT";s:7:"Default";s:4:"7654";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11: