y-bounded MultiVibe provider Host on your own supported NVIDIA GPU. Credentials and device identity are generated inside persistent appdata; the provider agent and managed Ollama stay loopback-only inside the container. Sharing and automatic downloads remain disabled until you explicitly configure the local capacity policy.";s:7:"Support";s:46:"https://github.com/thibautrey/multivibe/issues";s:7:"Project";s:39:"https://github.com/thibautrey/multivibe";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:95:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thibautrey/multivibe/main/packaging/unraid/multivibe-host.xml";s:6:"ReadMe";s:69:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thibautrey/multivibe/main/README.md";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:43:"AI LLM Ollama provider GPU NVIDIA inference";s:8:"Requires";s:190:"Unraid on x86_64, the Unraid Nvidia Driver plugin, and an NVIDIA GPU with compute capability 7.0 or newer. Set the Public URL to the exact LAN or HTTPS reverse-proxy origin used by browsers.";s:4:"Date";s:10:"2026-09-07";s:4:"Beta";s:4:"true";s:7:"License";s:10:"Apache-2.0";s:6:"Config";a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:6:"Web UI";s:6:"Target";s:4:"1455";s:7:"Default";s:4:"1455";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:56:"Host port for the protected MultiVibe dashboard and API.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"1455";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:16:"Application data";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/data";s:7:"Default";s:32:"/mnt/user/appdata/multivibe-host";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:75:"Persistent private credentials, device identity, policy, database and logs.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:32:"/mnt/user/appdata/multivibe-host";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"Model storage";s:6:"Target";s:7:"/models";s:7:"Default";s:26:"/mnt/user/multivibe-models";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:106:"Persistent managed runtime and model weights. Use /models/weights when creating the local capacity policy.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:26:"/mnt/user/multivibe-models";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"Public URL";s:6:"Target";s:25:"MULTIVIBE_HOST_PUBLIC_URL";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:220:"Required: enter your actual origin, for example http://192.168.1.10:1455. Match the Web UI host port; do not use [IP] or [PORT] placeholders. No path or trailing slash. Use the reverse-proxy HTTPS origin when applicable.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:4;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"NVIDIA GPU";s:6:"Target";s:22:"NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES";s:7:"Default";s:3:"all";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:126:"GPU UUID from the Nvidia Driver plugin, or all. Exposing one supported GPU is recommended; it is index 0 inside the container.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:3:"all";}i:5;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:19:"NVIDIA capabilities";s:6:"Target";s:26:"NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES";s:7:"Default";s:15:"compute,utility";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:50:"Required CUDA compute and nvidia-smi capabilities.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:15:"compute,utility";}i:6;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:25:"Managed runtime directory";s:6:"Target";s:26:"MULTIVIBE_HOST_MANAGED_DIR";s:7:"Default";s:15:"/models/runtime";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:123:"Container path for the verified managed Ollama runtime. Model weights are selected separately in the local capacity policy.";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s