A dashboard with health score, per-tracker analytics, and cross-seed effectiveness tells you what's wrong with your library. Five automated workflows fix it.

- Health score (0-100) showing how clean and efficient your library is
- Five workflows: Backfill (re-seed orphaned media via Sonarr/Radarr search), Cleanup (reviewed delete script for orphaned torrent files), Triage (explains every problem torrent — dead seeds, unregistered, superseded, pending imports — with rescan/exclude/delete actions), Dedupe (replace duplicate copies with verified hardlinks), Trumped (paste a tracker trump PM to swap the whole cross-seed group for its replacement)
- Upload analytics and library yield: daily upload volume per tracker, yield % over time, multi-tracker comparison charts
- Cross-seeding insights: weighted average seed multiplier, segmented disk bar, per-tracker breakdown
- Powerful file explorer with tree and flat views, filterable by status, tracker, seed count, size, filename
- File-level change log between every audit, kept indefinitely
- Sonarr/Radarr integration and a guided first-run setup wizard

Follows the TRaSH Guides folder structure. Read-only and non-destructive by default — all delete actions are opt-in, reviewed, and confirmed.";s:5:"WebUI";s:24:"http://[IP]:[PORT:8677]/";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:72:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thrill-burn/auditorr/main/auditorr.xml";s:4:"Icon";s:73:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thrill-burn/auditorr/main/docs/icon.png";s:6:"Config";a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:5:"WebUI";s:6:"Target";s:4:"8677";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8677";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:0:"";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8677";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:8:"App Data";s:6:"Target";s:9:"/app/data";s:7:"Default";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/auditorr/data";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:0:"";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:31:"/mnt/user/appdata/auditorr/data";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:4:"Data";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/data";s:7:"Default";s:14:"/mnt/user/data";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"ro";s:11:"Description";s:0:"";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:14:"/mnt/user/data";}i:3;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:13:"AUDITORR_PORT";s:6:"Target";s:13:"AUDITORR_PORT";s:7:"Default";s:4:"8677";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:0:"";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"8677";}i:4;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:15:"AUDITORR_SECRET";s:6:"Target";s:15:"AUDITORR_SECRET";s:7:"Default";s:0:"";s:4:"Mode";s:0:"";s:11:"Description";s:0:"";s:4:"Type";s:8:"Variable";s:7:"Display";s:8:"advanced";s:8:"Required";s:5:"false";s:4:"Mask";s:4:"true";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:5;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:25:"AUDITORR_TRUSTED_NETWORKS";s:6:"Target";s:25:"AUDITORR