per-server breakdowns. Users are identified by their Plex account rather than by the server they stream from, so one person stays one person no matter how many of your servers they watch on. Includes real-time session monitoring, watch trends and streaks, Tautulli history import, automation rules (concurrent stream limits, scheduled access, auto-termination) with Discord notifications, one-time invite links for co-admins, full backup and restore, and an installable PWA. Everything is stored locally in SQLite inside the config volume, with no external services required. Sign in with your Plex account and follow the setup wizard on first launch.";s:7:"Support";s:38:"https://github.com/thu3n/Plexmo/issues";s:7:"Project";s:18:"https://plexmo.app";s:11:"TemplateURL";s:82:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thu3n/unraid-templates/main/templates/plexmo.xml";s:6:"ReadMe";s:61:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thu3n/Plexmo/main/README.md";s:7:"Discord";s:29:"https://discord.gg/4rvmVg8Ejt";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:118:"plex tautulli tautulli-alternative monitoring statistics dashboard analytics multi-server multiple-servers multiserver";s:4:"Date";s:10:"2026-07-23";s:6:"MinVer";s:4:"6.12";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:6:"Config";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"3000";s:7:"Default";s:4:"3000";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:34:"Port for the Plexmo web interface.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:14:"Config storage";s:6:"Target";s:11:"/app/config";s:7:"Default";s:24:"/mnt/user/appdata/plexmo";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:68:"Database, settings and backups. Everything Plexmo stores lives here.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:0:"";}i:2;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:8:"Timezone";s:6:"Targe