y my work please consider supporting me on Ko-fi.";s:10:"DonateLink";s:28:"https://ko-fi.com/titandrive";s:10:"Compatible";b:1;s:16:"ModeratorComment";N;}i:4740;a:48:{s:4:"Name";s:3:"n8n";s:10:"Repository";s:9:"n8nio/n8n";s:8:"Registry";s:35:"https://hub.docker.com/r/n8nio/n8n/";s:7:"Network";s:6:"bridge";s:5:"Shell";s:2:"sh";s:10:"Privileged";s:5:"false";s:7:"Support";s:77:"https://forums.unraid.net/topic/97807-support-tmchow-n8n-workflow-automation/";s:7:"Project";s:15:"https://n8n.io/";s:8:"Overview";s:1271:"n8n (pronounced n-eight-n) helps you to interconnect every app with an API in the world with each other to share and manipulate its data without a single line of code. It is an easy to use, user-friendly and highly customizable service, which uses an intuitive user interface for you to design your unique workflows very fast. Hosted on your server and not based in the cloud, it keeps your sensible data very secure in your own trusted database.
    
    [br][br][b][u][span style='color: #E80000;']Configuration[/span][/u][/b][br]
    
    [b]Config[/b] : Storing n8n config and SQL Lite db for your personal workflows.[br]
    [b]Timezone[/b] : (Optional) Required for scheduling to know what time zone the workflows should be started. See https://momentjs.com/timezone/ to find your timezone string.[br]
