    Scans movies and TV, flags titles below a user-rating threshold you choose, shows a dry-run
    estimate of the space that would be freed, and only deletes after you review the list and type
    DELETE. Extra tools: a "Biggest items" view to clear large titles you never watch, an
    "Empty / 0-byte cleanup" toggle (removes empty entries that are also below your threshold, plus
    orphaned empty folders), per-title "exclude from future scans", and optional Overseerr/Jellyseerr
    sync so deletions stop being auto-requeued.

    Defaults to DRY-RUN-ONLY and never deletes outside your media folder. Everything else — Radarr,
