Independent modules - turn on what fits, ignore the rest:

- Dashboard - today's tasks, events, meals and reminders at a glance
- Tasks - shared to-dos with priorities, due dates and assignees
- Shopping - collaborative grocery lists, auto-sorted by category
- Meals & Recipes - weekly meal planner with a built-in recipe book
- Pantry - what's actually in the house, with storage places and best-before alerts
- Calendar - family calendar with recurring events and reminders
- Budget - income, expenses, accounts, subscriptions and loans, with shared costs split automatically
- Health - vitals, medications, lab results and activity, per household member
- Rewards - points on chores, a parent-approved catalogue and an auditable ledger
- Inventory - what you own, with warranties and deadlines (off by default)
- Housekeeping - chores, supplies and staff/session tracking
- Waste collection - pickup schedules per waste type, or a subscribed municipal ICS calendar (off by default)
- Documents - store and find important household files
- Notes, Contacts & Birthdays - everything else in one tidy place

Why Yuvomi:

- Mobile-first PWA - install it on any phone, works offline
- Light & dark mode, fast and polished (no bloated frameworks, no build step)
- Optional sync - CalDAV / CardDAV, Apple and Google Calendar
- OIDC single sign-on for households that already run an identity provider
- Encrypted-at-rest storage (SQLCipher) with automated, scheduled backups
- Multi-language, fully self-contained and MIT-licensed

- Setup -

REQUIRED: Set a long random SESSION_SECRET.
RECOMMENDED: Set a strong DB_ENCRYPTION_KEY to encrypt the database at rest - without it the database and any synced calendar/contact credentials are stored unencrypted.
Generate either secret with: openssl rand -base64 48

After the container starts, open the WebUI - the first visit guides you through creating your admin account. (Headless setups can alternatively run node setup.js in the container console.) Then log in - pick the modules you want and invite your family.";s:7:"Support";s:40:"https://github.com/ulsklyc/yuvomi/issues";s:7:"Project";s:33:"https://github.com/ulsklyc/yuvomi";s:6:"ReadMe";s:63:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ulsklyc/yuvomi/main/README.md";s:7:"License";s:3:"MIT";s:16:"ExtraSearchTerms";s:175:"family planner household organizer tasks groceries shopping meals recipes pantry inventory expiry calendar budget chores notes contacts birthdays caldav carddav pwa selfhosted";s:10:"Screenshot";a:5:{i:0;s:105:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ulsklyc/yuvomi/main/docs/screenshots/unraid/dashboard-combined-dark.png";i:1;s:104:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ulsklyc/yuvomi/main/docs/screenshots/unraid/calendar-combined-dark.png";i:2;s:101:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ulsklyc/yuvomi/main/docs/screenshots/unraid/meals-combined-dark.png";i:3;s:104:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ulsklyc/yuvomi/main/docs/screenshots/unraid/shopping-combined-dark.png";i:4;s:102:"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ulsklyc/yuvomi/main/docs/screenshots/unraid/budget-combined-dark.png";}s:6:"Config";a:77:{i:0;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:10:"WebUI Port";s:6:"Target";s:4:"3000";s:7:"Default";s:4:"3000";s:4:"Mode";s:3:"tcp";s:11:"Description";s:39:"Host port for the Yuvomi web interface.";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Port";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:4:"3000";}i:1;a:2:{s:11:"@attributes";a:9:{s:4:"Name";s:4:"Data";s:6:"Target";s:5:"/data";s:7:"Default";s:29:"/mnt/user/appdata/yuvomi/data";s:4:"Mode";s:2:"rw";s:11:"Description";s:50:"Database and stored app data (uploads, documents).";s:4:"Type";s:4:"Path";s:7:"Display";s:6:"always";s:8:"Required";s:4:"true";s:4:"Mask";s:5:"false";}s:5:"value";s:29:"/mnt/user/appdata/yuvom